      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="It had 240 programs printed by Lakeview Print on May 20." data-hint="Keep the quantity, provider, and date together." data-fix="The center had 240 programs printed by Lakeview Print on May 20."><p class="quiz-question">2. How did the center arrange the printed materials?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="It had 240 programs printed by Lakeview Print on May 20.">It had 240 programs printed by Lakeview Print on May 20.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="It printed 20 programs through Metro Lift on May 240.">It printed 20 programs through Metro Lift on May 240.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="It had Lakeview Print serviced by 240 programs.">It had Lakeview Print serviced by 240 programs.</button></div></div>
